        "created_at": "2011-11-06T19:40:20.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I believe it’s the second one.   Gotta be careful with what stuff you get out vs Omnitron for just that exact reason.   Or destroy those obsidian fields… or both.</p>\n<p>-awp</p>",
